{"kind": "mod", "id": 2086, "name": "SmokeRework", "slug": "smokerework", "teaser": "Tweak the look of every shot", "owner_name": "Netnikogo", "downloads": 3292, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:59:06.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-05T20:45:08.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-04-05T20:45:08.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><em>Tired of not being able to see anything because of excessive smoke when firing full auto? This mod is made for you !</em></p>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"z3NI7DY8-IY\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/z3NI7DY8-IY?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/z3NI7DY8-IY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p>This mod allows you to <strong>reduce</strong>, or <strong>increase</strong> the visual effects of weapons:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The two types of smoke generated by the weapon:</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>lingering smoke cloud that stays in front of you — the most annoying one, as it reflects light from muzzle flashes and flashlights</li>\n<li>smoke expelled directly from the barrel</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>muzzle flash at the end of the barrel</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>ambient light produced in the room</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>menu options : F12</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Extract</strong> : ==&gt; BepInEx/plugins &lt;==</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3292, "published_at": "2025-04-05T20:45:08.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/